{"id":400,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Bibarel fur repels water and is also a fantastic material for heat retention. These Pokémon create dams on rivers to live in."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. It is known as an industrious worker."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It busily makes its nest with stacks of branches and roots it has cut up with its sharp incisors."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"While its movements out of water are sluggish, it can swim as fast as any FEEBAS."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Simple","hidden":false,"description":"Doubles the effects of the Pokémon's stat changes."},{"name":"Unaware","hidden":false,"description":"When attacking, the Pokémon ignores the target's stat changes."},{"name":"Moody","hidden":true,"description":"Every turn, one of the Pokémon's stats will be boosted sharply but another stat will be lowered."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":399,"name":"Bidoof","condition":null,"children":[{"id":400,"name":"Bibarel","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[0,55],[1,33],[1,45],[1,453],[1,563],[5,111],[9,205],[13,29],[18,158],[23,281],[28,242],[33,36],[38,162],[43,14],[48,133],[53,276],[58,174]],"machine":[213,59,523,451,590,104,497,263,374,218,416,447,237,63,58,182,240,156,216,496,503,247,214,164,241,57,207,14,269,168,87,86,85,92,127,526],"egg":[],"tutor":[401,343,264,196,231,387,710,351,173,446,707,162,276,352]},"cards":[{"id":"swsh12pt5gg-GG25","name":"Bibarel","set":"Crown Zenith Galarian Gallery","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Trainer Gallery Rare Holo","number":"GG25